llow3D` produces. I narrowed it down to this `else` block, and tried putting the orthonormalization on a few different lines. From my tests, all three of `sample_baked_with_rotation`, `correct_posture`, and the `tilt_enabled` block produce a meaningful amount of error. A single call to `orthonormalize` after all of them is enough to stop the error from carrying into the next iteration. ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","description":"","color":"ff7766","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-08-01T22:26:23Z","updated_at":"2025-08-05T17:22:06Z","closed_at":"2025-08-04T23:01:42Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"68b01e75d30848ee131fff24717859d4a01c06a2","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"precup:fix-pathfollow3d-basis-drift","ref":"fix-pathfollow3d-basis-drift","repo":{"id":930796935,"node_id":"R_kgDON3rVhw